        }
      ],
      "fallback": "CH01_EP03_N006B"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_N006A",
      "type": "passage",
      "title": "台灯下面",
      "category": "main",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "程安然看他拿起信封，停下了敲键盘。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "ANRAN",
          "text": "想看就看。我忙我的。"
        },
        {
          "text": "她把电脑往自己这边收了一点，给他留出一块空地方。周叙点头，把信纸抽了出来。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "CH01_EP03_LETTER_001",
      "lifeContext": {
        "time": {
          "year": 2037,
          "month": 9,
          "season": "autumn",
          "label": "2037 · 秋 · 深夜",
          "location": "家中",
          "timeline": "present"
        },
        "stage": "middleAge"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP03_N006B",
      "type": "passage",
      "title": "台灯下面",
      "category": "main",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "周叙拿起信封。程安然看了一眼，又回到那份材料上。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "ANRAN",
          "text": "别太晚。"
        },
        {
          "text": "他答应了一声。信纸卡在封口，他用指尖慢慢拨开，没有碰到放在旁边的水杯。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "CH01_EP03_LETTER_001",
      "lifeContext": {
        "time": {
          "year": 2037,
          "month": 9,
          "season": "autumn",
          "label": "2037 · 秋 · 深夜",
          "location": "家中",
